9
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:51,620
Things have changed now,

10
00:00:52,020 --> 00:00:56,117
for together we found, we looked
through the spyglass and see.

11
00:00:56,200 --> 00:01:01,737
And we know that our hearts
have brought us here.

12
00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:05,357
Where the conscious point's our destiny.

13
00:01:05,440 --> 00:01:09,097
There's no looking back,
take the hell with me!

14
00:01:09,180 --> 00:01:13,660
We can't stop all our
troubles, forget the past.

15
00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:18,197
Though the future's
unclear, we still can smile.

16
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:21,337
We know we'll get the regrets.

17
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:25,317
Every tear that we pride only helps.

18
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:26,740
Saw dreams come true.

19
00:01:27,620 --> 00:01:32,720
You and those dreams
are precious in my life.

