63
00:04:41,300 --> 00:04:45,440
It is a poneglyph, writings
left over from ancient history.

64
00:04:46,140 --> 00:04:49,964
You mean this isn't something that
was written by your ancestors?

65
00:04:50,740 --> 00:04:53,152
There is only one thing we know for sure.

66
00:04:53,260 --> 00:04:57,277
That the city of Shandora fought and
fell trying to protect this stone.

67
00:04:57,360 --> 00:04:58,720
And we will too.

68
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:03,400
We feel it is our duty to continue
to protect it with the same resolve.

69
00:05:03,780 --> 00:05:09,040
This stone now represents proof that our
ancestors not only fought a vicious fight,

70
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:10,420
