74
00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:25,130
Yes.

75
00:05:25,220 --> 00:05:28,797
It speaks so that the spirits
of our ancestors who have passed

76
00:05:28,880 --> 00:05:32,840
can still return to this land at
any time without getting lost.

77
00:05:33,340 --> 00:05:37,640
We continue to ring the bell as
if to shout to them, We are here.

78
00:05:37,900 --> 00:05:38,780
Come home.

79
00:05:39,260 --> 00:05:40,717
We are waiting for you.

80
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,320
And the sound?

81
00:05:42,580 --> 00:05:45,800
The sound itself proclaims
the glory of Shandora,

82
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:49,940
making its existence known
to the ends of the sea.

83
00:05:50,200 --> 00:05:53,300
It shouts, we will never run or hide.

84
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:56,957
Because of this, we have
given the Grand Bell a name.

85
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,980
We call it the Fire of Shandora.

86
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:00,670
Makes sense.

87
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:03,080
That explains the majestic sound.

88
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:04,940
You think so? Yeah.

89
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:10,400
It was this fire that reached out
to us and helped us arrive here.

90
00:06:11,460 --> 00:06:14,360
