Please, it's been 400
years since Shandora fell.

98
00:06:48,660 --> 00:06:52,057
And you're the first guest we've
had, so I want to welcome you.

99
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:53,669
Won't you accept my offer?

100
00:06:55,380 --> 00:06:56,615
Thank you, Kal 'gara.

101
00:06:56,900 --> 00:06:57,977
And with your permission,

102
00:06:58,060 --> 00:07:00,457
I would also love the opportunity
to collect some plants

103
