those who intruded upon us.

112
00:07:17,020 --> 00:07:20,460
Yes, that skull shape is
definitely our island.

113
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:24,400
The name Shandora means
the skull's right eye.

114
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:28,020
