151
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:05,078
You're not welcome.

152
00:10:05,260 --> 00:10:06,540
You're outsiders.

153
00:10:07,060 --> 00:10:08,957
Kalgara doesn't want to see you anymore.

154
00:10:09,040 --> 00:10:09,900
