155
00:10:12,620 --> 00:10:14,679
When are you going to leave anyway?

156
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,020
Answer me!

157
00:10:18,420 --> 00:10:23,597
What's going on it seems like
they suddenly hate us now

158
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:27,017
hold on you can't just start
acting like this it's not fair

159
00:10:27,100 --> 00:10:31,617
let it go let's continue our

160
00:10:31,700 --> 00:10:35,617
work we still have some forest

161
