can't wait to get off this insane island.

177
00:11:27,020 --> 00:11:28,902
Only after we finish our duties.

178
00:11:29,760 --> 00:11:30,590
Good night.

179
00:11:32,580 --> 00:11:34,500
You should stay here, Noland.

180
00:11:34,820 --> 00:11:35,740
