181
00:11:36,060 --> 00:11:38,119
Why don't you make Moose your wife?

182
00:11:39,120 --> 00:11:40,137
Don't be silly.

183
00:11:40,220 --> 00:11:43,320
I have a family at home
and kids who are her age.

184
00:11:44,420 --> 00:11:45,700
You're outsiders.

185
