men are getting ready to leave.

251
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:34,180
Moose, where have you been?

252
00:16:37,840 --> 00:16:38,960
What if...

253
00:16:43,560 --> 00:16:46,837
What if you knew a single tree
was tainted by the forest,

254
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:51,155
